  "242": "Documentation Philosophy: KISS/DRY, exactly 4 core docs - rationale: prior 10+ overlapping docs left developers lost in the repo",
  "243": "AppError / SolanaError Error Handling System with getLogger and handleError",
  "244": "Hybrid Client/Server Architecture (client signs, server prepares via private RPC) - rationale: privacy-first, no server-held keys, no rate-limited public RPC on server",
